# Origin of the backend running on the VM — scheme and host only, no /api, no
# trailing slash. Baked into the bundle at build time, so changing it in Vercel
# requires a redeploy. Leave it unset locally: the Vite dev proxy in
# vite.config.ts already forwards /api to http://localhost:8000.
#
# Must be https:// — Vercel serves the frontend over TLS and browsers block a
# plain-http request from an https page.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
